er, but you both might die."],["","      ",{text:"TRAVELLER",bold:true,italic:false,color:gray,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Butcher",italic:false,underlined:true,color:gray,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Butcher"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:gray},"Each day, after the 1st execution, you may nominate again."],["","      ",{text:"TRAVELLER",bold:true,italic:false,color:gray,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Cacklejack",italic:false,underlined:true,color:gray,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Cacklejack"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:gray},"Each day, choose a player: a different player changes character tonight."],["","      ",{text:"TRAVELLER",bold:true,italic:false,color:gray,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Gunslinger",italic:false,underlined:true,color:gray,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Gunslinger"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:gray},"Each day, after the 1st vote has been tallied, you may choose a player that voted: they die."],["","      ",{text:"TRAVELLER",bold:true,italic:false,color:gray,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Matron",italic:false,underlined:true,color:gray,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Matron"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:gray},"Each day, you may choose up to 3 sets of 2 players to swap seats. Players may not leave their seats to talk in private."],["","      ",{text:"TRAVELLER",bold:true,italic:false,color:gray,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Gangster",italic:false,underlined:true,color:gray,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Gangster"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:gray},"Once per day, you may choose to kill an alive neighbor, if your other alive neighbor agrees."],["","      ",{text:"TRAVELLER",bold:true,italic:false,color:gray,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Bone Collector",italic:false,underlined:true,color:gray,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Bone%20Collector"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:gray},"Once per game, at night*, choose a dead player: they regain their ability until dusk."],["","      ",{text:"TRAVELLER",bold:true,italic:false,color:gray,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Judge",italic:false,underlined:true,color:gray,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Judge"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:gray},"Once per game, if another player nominated, you may choose to force the current execution to pass or fail."],["","      ",{text:"TRAVELLER",bold:true,italic:false,color:gray,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Apprentice",italic:false,underlined:true,color:gray,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Apprentice"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:gray},"On your 1st night, you gain a Townsfolk ability (if good), or a Minion ability (if evil)."],["","      ",{text:"TRAVELLER",bold:true,italic:false,color:gray,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Beggar",italic:false,underlined:true,color:gray,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Beggar"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:gray},"You must use a vote token to vote. If a dead player gives you theirs, you learn their alignment. You are sober & healthy."],["","      ",{text:"TRAVELLER",bold:true,italic:false,color:gray,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Deviant",italic:false,underlined:true,color:gray,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Deviant"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:gray},"If you were funny today, you cannot die by exile."],["","      ",{text:"TRAVELLER",bold:true,italic:false,color:gray,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Scapegoat",italic:false,underlined:true,color:gray,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Scapegoat"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:gray},"If a player of your alignment is executed, you might be executed instead."],["","      ",{text:"TRAVELLER",bold:true,italic:false,color:gray,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Gnome",italic:false,underlined:true,color:gray,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Gnome"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:gray},"All players start knowing a player of your alignment. You may choose to kill anyone who nominates them."],["","      ",{text:"TRAVELLER",bold:true,italic:false,color:gray,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Bishop",italic:false,underlined:true,color:gray,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Bishop"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:gray},"Only the Storyteller can nominate. At least 1 opposing player must be nominated each day."],["","      ",{text:"TRAVELLER",bold:true,italic:false,color:gray,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Voudon",italic:false,underlined:true,color:gray,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Voudon"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:gray},"Only you & the dead can vote. They don't need a vote token to do so. A 50% majority isn't required."]],title:"",author:""},custom_name={text:"The Travellers Script",bold:true,italic:false,underlined:true,color:black},lore=[{text:"Useful role cheat sheet for ",italic:false,color:gray},[{text:"The Travellers",italic:false,color:black},{text:" script.",italic:false,color:gray}]]]